								<a href="https://koolykh88.flashleapaff.com/#/?code=6kHcdCND" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="mt-4 w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30 hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
